 posé The Facebook Files. The film is inspired by the true story of how Fr
 ances Haugen (Madison)\, a young Facebook engineer\, enlists the help of J
 eff Horwitz (White)\, a Wall Street Journal reporter\, to go on a dangerou
 s journey that ends up blowing the whistle on the social network’s most 
